      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHILLI CRUMPET (4) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing third (23.79) at this track over 410m. Key chance in this line up. PAW KRISTELLE (7) comes off an average effort last start when seventh at The Meadows over 525m behind Tarbhach (31.09) in a Grade 5. Scored at her previous run. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. One of the main contenders. PAW RAZOR (2) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has hit the frame at his last three runs, the latest finishing third (20.37) at Traralgon. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to his name from 14 starts. Overdue and expected to feature again. GAMORA BALE (1) is in fine form and looks a good top-three chance again.",
